    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Awaken Your Spellbook</p></blockquote><p>Magic of the book—that's what many folk call wizardry, and the name is apt, given how much time Wizards spend poring over tomes and penning theories about magic. Among Wizards, the Scribes are the most bookish. Their mission is the same everywhere: to record magical discoveries so that wizardry can flourish. And while every Wizard values a spellbook, a Scribe magically awakens theirs, turning it into a trusted companion. All Wizards study books, but a Scribe talks to theirs!</p><p><em>The Order of Scribes of Tasha's Cauldron of Everything, adapted to the 2024 rules by Owidyn: features at Wizard levels 3, 6, 10, and 14.</em></p><h3>Scribe Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.KmMAq1Pt0ePIQbxE]{Wizardly Quill}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.a7mCHcXZChV50cpz]{Awakened Spellbook}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.D9NBAXxFBdPamwEt]{Manifest Mind}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.aAByOLxudhbqSAxz]{Master Scrivener}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.moP8TI310FTdbGPY]{One with the Word}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "chat": ""
    },
